146
00:26:46.440 --> 00:27:03.579
Stefano Gogioso: And we did FLOC, which is the one that performs the best, to be honest, but we did not do the on-chain verification yet, so that's… that's still open work, because we only did it recently. So that's something… we don't have figures for exactly how much gas it would, in principle, take to verify one of these flock proofs, but we know how big they are.

